# Task: Find repository related to "AI 1인 기업 OS" or "Connect AI" in wonseokjung's GitHub.

## Plan
1. [x] Navigate to https://github.com/wonseokjung
2. [x] Search for repositories matching keywords
3. [x] Find clone URL and setup instructions
4. [x] Report findings

## Findings
- **Repository:** https://github.com/wonseokjung/connect-ai
- **Clone URL:** `https://github.com/wonseokjung/connect-ai.git`
- **Setup Instructions:**
    - **A.U Membership User (Recommended):**
        1. Go to the [Releases](https://github.com/wonseokjung/connect-ai/releases) page.
        2. Download the latest `.vsix` file.
        3. In VS Code, run `Extensions: Install from VSIX` and select the file.
    - **Build from Source:**
        ```bash
        git clone https://github.com/wonseokjung/connect-ai.git
        cd connect-ai
        npm install
        npm run compile
        npx vsce package
        ```
- **Engine Setup (LM Studio):**
    1. Install from `lmstudio.ai`.
    2. Start Server in the Developer tab.
    3. Select "LM Studio" in Connect AI settings.
